{"seq":1,"slug":"dao-governance-economics","title":"DAO 治理经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/governance-regulation/dao-governance-economics","wordCount":1683,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"dao-治理经济学\">DAO 治理经济学</h1><p>去中心化自治组织（DAO）将公司治理的投票、提案和执行搬到链上——代币替代股份、智能合约替代董事会决议、链上投票替代股东大会。但这种「代码即法律」的治理结构并没有消除治理经济学的老问题：搭便车、寡头控制、选民冷漠和短期主义。理解 DAO 治理需要同时运用公共选择理论、委托代理模型和机制设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>理性冷漠（Rational Apathy）</strong>：个体投票的预期收益低于研究成本时，理性选择不参与</li>\n<li><strong>代币加权投票</strong>：每单位代币 = 一票，结构性利好大户、易导致寡头治理</li>\n<li><strong>veToken 模型</strong>：锁定代币换取投票权，用时间偏好对齐长期利益</li>\n<li><strong>治理攻击</strong>：通过临时获取大量投票权（含闪电贷）通过有利提案</li>\n<li><strong>委托代理问题</strong>：DAO 金库管理者（代理人）的利益可能偏离代币持有者（委托人）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"代币投票的经济学模型\">代币投票的经济学模型</h2><p>DAO 治理最常见的形式是代币加权投票（token-weighted voting）：每单位代币 = 一票。这在结构上等价于公司治理中的一股一票，但有关键差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>上市公司</th>\n<th>DAO</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>投票权获取</td>\n<td>购买股票（有监管限制）</td>\n<td>购买代币（通常无限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>身份要求</td>\n<td>实名股东登记</td>\n<td>假名/匿名地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投票成本</td>\n<td>几乎为零（代理投票）</td>\n<td>gas 费 + 注意力成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息环境</td>\n<td>强制信息披露（10-K/10-Q）</td>\n<td>自愿披露，差异极大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律约束</td>\n<td>信义义务、证券法</td>\n<td>几乎无（Smart contract is law）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投票频率</td>\n<td>年度股东大会 + 特别事项</td>\n<td>持续（周级别提案频率）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"搭便车与理性冷漠\">搭便车与理性冷漠</h2><p>DAO 治理面临的首要问题是<strong>理性冷漠（rational apathy）</strong>——对单个代币持有者而言，花时间研究提案并投票的成本超过其个人投票对结果的边际影响。</p>\n<p>设代币持有者 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 持有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 代币（占总投票权的比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i/W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>），研究提案的成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，投票对协议价值的边际贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。理性投票条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>W</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{w_i}{W} \\cdot \\Delta V &gt; c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于持有比例极小的散户（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i/W &lt; 0.01\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01%</span></span></span></span></span>），即使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 很大，投票的预期私人收益也接近于零。实证数据证实：大多数 DAO 的投票参与率低于 10%，部分提案的通过仅需要几个鲸鱼地址的参与。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[提案发布] --&gt; B{代币持有者决策}&#10;    B --&gt;|大户: 影响力大, 值得研究| C[积极参与投票]&#10;    B --&gt;|散户: 影响力微小| D[理性选择不参与]&#10;    D --&gt; E[投票参与率低]&#10;    E --&gt; F[少数大户决定结果]&#10;    F --&gt; G[寡头化治理]&#10;    G --&gt; H[散户更无动力参与]&#10;    H --&gt; E&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; I[提案通过/否决]&#10;    I --&gt; J[执行结果]&#10;    J --&gt;|好决策| K[协议价值上升]&#10;    J --&gt;|被操控| L[少数人利益最大化]\">graph TD\n    A[提案发布] --&gt; B{代币持有者决策}\n    B --&gt;|大户: 影响力大, 值得研究| C[积极参与投票]\n    B --&gt;|散户: 影响力微小| D[理性选择不参与]\n    D --&gt; E[投票参与率低]\n    E --&gt; F[少数大户决定结果]\n    F --&gt; G[寡头化治理]\n    G --&gt; H[散户更无动力参与]\n    H --&gt; E\n\n    C --&gt; I[提案通过/否决]\n    I --&gt; J[执行结果]\n    J --&gt;|好决策| K[协议价值上升]\n    J --&gt;|被操控| L[少数人利益最大化]</pre><h2 id=\"治理攻击的经济分析\">治理攻击的经济分析</h2><p>代币投票的开放性使得「治理攻击」成为经济可行的策略。攻击者临时获取大量投票权（通过购买或借贷），通过有利于自身的提案后退出。</p>\n<p><strong>闪电贷治理攻击</strong>的经济条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Attack\\_Profit = Value\\_Extracted\\_by\\_Proposal - Flash\\_Loan\\_Fee - Gas\\_Cost</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>防御手段包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间锁（Timelock）</strong>：提案通过后延迟执行，给社区反应时间</li>\n<li><strong>投票锁定</strong>：投票时代币被锁定，防止同一代币反复投票</li>\n<li><strong>委托（Delegation）</strong>：用户将投票权委托给专业代表，提高参与率</li>\n<li><strong>二次方投票（Quadratic Voting）</strong>：投票权 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{tokens}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，削弱鲸鱼影响力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"vetoken-模型-时间偏好的机制设计\">veToken 模型：时间偏好的机制设计</h2><p>Curve 首创的 veToken（vote-escrowed token）模型要求用户锁定代币 1-4 年才能获得投票权，锁定时间越长投票权越大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">veCRV = CRV \\cdot \\frac{lock\\_time}{4\\_years}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">4_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一设计的经济逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对齐长期利益</strong>：强制投票者承受代币价格波动（skin in the game），减少短期投机性投票</li>\n<li><strong>创造时间偏好市场</strong>：急需流动性的持有者不参与治理，只有长期看好的持有者掌权</li>\n<li><strong>产生「贿赂经济」</strong>：协议方付费购买 veCRV 持有者的投票权（通过 Convex/Votium），将治理权分配转化为公开市场</li>\n</ul>\n<p>veToken 的副作用是资本锁定带来的<strong>退出成本极高</strong>——一旦锁定 4 年，即使协议走向失败，持有者也无法退出。这与公司治理中的「wall street walk」（不满意就卖股票走人）机制缺失形成对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dao-金库管理的委托代理问题\">DAO 金库管理的委托代理问题</h2><p>大型 DAO 控制着数十亿美元的金库资产（Treasury），面临典型的委托代理问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Agency\\_Cost = Monitoring\\_Cost + Bonding\\_Cost + Residual\\_Loss</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oss</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DAO</th>\n<th>金库规模（估）</th>\n<th>主要代理问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Uniswap</td>\n<td>$30-40 亿（UNI 代币）</td>\n<td>fee switch 迟迟不开（利益冲突）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lido</td>\n<td>$5-10 亿</td>\n<td>节点运营商选择与绩效监督</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Arbitrum</td>\n<td>$30-50 亿（ARB 代币）</td>\n<td>拨款效率与资金流失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MakerDAO (Sky)</td>\n<td>$20-30 亿</td>\n<td>RWA 投资的信用风险管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>金库管理的去中心化困境：让所有代币持有者投票决定每笔支出效率极低（信息不对称 + 注意力有限），但委托给小团队又引入信任风险。大多数成熟 DAO 演化出「委员会/子DAO」结构——形式上的去中心化，实质上的代议制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理代币的估值悖论\">治理代币的估值悖论</h2><p>治理代币面临一个估值悖论：如果治理仅是投票权（无现金流权利），理性持有者应该不愿意为此支付溢价——投票权对个人的价值趋近于零（理性冷漠）。</p>\n<p>治理代币能维持非零价值的原因：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>期权性（optionality）</strong>：可能未来开启 fee switch、分红或回购</li>\n<li><strong>控制权溢价</strong>：大额持有者可以影响数十亿美元金库的分配</li>\n<li><strong>贿赂市场</strong>：其他协议为获取投票权付费（Curve war）</li>\n<li><strong>投机需求</strong>：市场参与者根据叙事而非基本面定价</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种估值结构意味着治理代币的价格更接近「看涨期权」而非「现金流折现资产」——高度依赖叙事和市场情绪，而非可预测的未来收益。</p>\n<p>关于治理决策如何影响协议的经济参数设置（如利率曲线、手续费比例），参见 <a href=\"../defi-protocols/lending-borrowing-protocols\">借贷协议经济模型</a>。而外部监管框架如何约束 DAO 的运作空间，详见 <a href=\"regulatory-framework-compliance\">监管框架与合规经济</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>DAO 治理将公司治理的老问题（搭便车、寡头控制、委托代理）搬到了链上，但并没有解决它们——只是换了表现形式。代币加权投票天然利好大户，理性冷漠使大多数散户不参与，治理攻击的低门槛（闪电贷）要求额外防御机制。veToken 模型通过时间锁定对齐长期利益，但创造了流动性贿赂的二级市场。治理代币的估值更接近看涨期权而非现金流资产——高度依赖叙事和期权性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DAO 治理经济学","id":"dao-治理经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代币投票的经济学模型","id":"代币投票的经济学模型"},{"level":2,"text":"搭便车与理性冷漠","id":"搭便车与理性冷漠"},{"level":2,"text":"治理攻击的经济分析","id":"治理攻击的经济分析"},{"level":2,"text":"veToken 模型：时间偏好的机制设计","id":"vetoken-模型-时间偏好的机制设计"},{"level":2,"text":"DAO 金库管理的委托代理问题","id":"dao-金库管理的委托代理问题"},{"level":2,"text":"治理代币的估值悖论","id":"治理代币的估值悖论"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"加密衍生品与永续合约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/derivatives-perpetuals"},"next":{"title":"监管框架与合规经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/governance-regulation/regulatory-framework-compliance"}}